 LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/25">25.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/25">Interpretation of Part 2</a></span></p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2016/14/part/3">PART 3 Ill-treatment and wilful neglect</a></p><ol><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2016/14/part/3/crossheading/offences-by-care-workers-and-care-providers"><em>Offences by care workers and care providers</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/26">26.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/26">Care worker offence</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/27">27.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/27">Care provider offence</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/28">28.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/28">Meaning of “care worker” and “care provider” etc.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/29">29.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2016/14/section/29">Disclosure of conviction for offence under section 26</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2016/14/part/3/crossheading/remedial-orders-and-publicity-orders"><em>Remedial orders and publicity orders</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem Le